Package: konjecture
Title: Core Functionality for the KONjecture Nowcast Archive
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("KONjecture", "Project", email = "news378@team706.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data transforms, nowcast models (AR benchmark, DFM bridge,
    MIDAS bridge) behind a common adapter interface, vintage-correct scoring
    stratified by horizon bucket, and the SVG chart/site builders for the
    KONjecture GDP nowcast archive. Contains only
    composable functions with no hard-coded paths or top-level side effects;
    the usage layers (targets pipeline, ingest and site scripts) supply paths
    and orchestration. See CLAUDE.md ground rules at the repository root.
